00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:22.360
So, they've finally come...

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:26.230
Now the fight really begins!

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:29.190
Let's see our treasures through this crisis!

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:30.430
Yeah!

